  id: hamlet-defeat-witch
  title: Freeze Morwen and let the keepers burn her herbs
  briefing:
  - Nothing of yours will hurt her, the herbs in her hat keep her whole!
  - Hold her still with the Oathbranch and our rue will find her!
  - "And mind her poison \u2014 three breaths of it and we are done for. Carry us
    out of it!"
